ider readership can appreciate the range and depth of Rumi's intellect and imagination, and discover why it is so often said that in Rumi the Persian mystical genius found its supreme expression."},"latest_revision":10,"revision":10,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-11-05T05:17:06.997866"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-07-18T05:27:10.336797"}}},"ISBN:9780195779899":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780195779899","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL22386112M/The_life_and_work_of_Jaluluddin_Rumi","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL22386112M/The_life_and_work_of_Jaluluddin_Rumi","details":{"publishers":["Oxford University Press"],"identifiers":{"goodreads":["2750895"],"librarything":["1778487"]},"isbn_10":["0195779894"],"pagination":"xxviii, 330 p. ;","lc_classifications":[""],"latest_revision":6,"key":"/books/OL22386112M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL12015A","name":"Iqbal, Afzal."}],"publish_places":["Karachi","Oxford"],"contributions":["Pakistan National Council of the Arts."],"genres":["Biography."],"revision":6,"source_records":["marc:marc_binghamton_univ/bgm_openlib_final_10-15.mrc:319461930:1005","bwb:9780195779899"],"title":"The life and work of Jaluluddin Rumi","oclc_number":["41959047"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Originally published: 1956.\n\nAt foot of title: Pakistan National Council of the Arts, Islamabad (Pakistan).\n\nIncludes bibliographical references and index."},"number_of_pages":330,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-11-12T09:45:25.636592"},"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Jalāl al-Dīn Rūmī, -- Maulana, -- 1207-1273,","Poets, Persian -- 13th century -- Biography"],"publish_date":"1999","publish_country":"enk","last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-10-10T18:02:42.895970"},"by_statement":"Afzal Iqbal ; foreword by A.J. Arberry.","works":[{"key":"/works/OL376712W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"location":["BIN"]}},"ISBN:978076790